('23', '1', '2023-12-21 11:57:28', '2023-12-21 11:57:28', '<style>/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 07-02-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h3>Minimalism and fantasy</h3>		\n			<a role=\"button\">\n						Explore collection\n					</a>\n			<a role=\"button\">\n					</a>\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 07-02-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"492\" height=\"680\" src=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GettyImages-1402673175.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GettyImages-1402673175.jpg 492w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GettyImages-1402673175-64x88.jpg 64w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GettyImages-1402673175-217x300.jpg 217w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 492px) 100vw, 492px\" />													\n			<h2>the story</h2>		\n		<p>One Vintage is a distinctive luxury brand founded by Simone Myson in 2010. This avant-garde label ingeniously revitalizes antique textiles and relics, seamlessly weaving them into contemporary and modern masterpieces.</p>		\n			<a role=\"button\">\n						Discover more\n					</a>\n			<h4>What’s new</h4>		\n			<a role=\"button\">\n						View all\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"434\" height=\"592\" src=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GettyImages-1402673190.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GettyImages-1402673190.jpg 434w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GettyImages-1402673190-64x87.jpg 64w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/GettyImages-1402673190-220x300.jpg 220w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 434px) 100vw, 434px\" />													\n		<p>Cashmere — wool yarns</p>		\n			Fall/Winter 23		\n			<h2>Fall collection</h2>		\n		<p>Our new Fall/Winter 2023 Collection features vibrant hues and varied textures in charming plaids and floral prints that pair back to easy-fitting and thoughtfully tailored silhouettes.</p>		\n			<a role=\"button\">\n						Explore collection\n					</a>\n		<p>Is about you being confident self, no matter what others say or think</p>		\n													<img width=\"705\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/farol-106-pnSxWxfVJs8-unsplash-705x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/farol-106-pnSxWxfVJs8-unsplash-705x1024.jpg 705w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/farol-106-pnSxWxfVJs8-unsplash-64x93.jpg 64w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/farol-106-pnSxWxfVJs8-unsplash-650x945.jpg 650w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/farol-106-pnSxWxfVJs8-unsplash-206x300.jpg 206w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/farol-106-pnSxWxfVJs8-unsplash.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 705px) 100vw, 705px\" />													\n			<a role=\"button\">\n						Ready to wear\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"705\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/jonathan-sanchez-KTF4MPh6kos-unsplash-705x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://inno