('1338', '1', '2024-01-05 07:45:38', '2024-01-05 07:45:38', 'DETAILED CRAFTSMANSHIP				\n					<h1>THE CUSTOM CLOTHING EXPERIENCE YOU DESERVE</h1>				\n					<a role=\"button\">\n									Book an appoitment\n					</a>\n						[elementor-template id=\"6801\"]					\n						[elementor-template id=\"6805\"]					\n						[elementor-template id=\"6815\"]					\n						[elementor-template id=\"6823\"]					\n						[elementor-template id=\"6832\"]					\n						[elementor-template id=\"7545\"]					\n						[elementor-template id=\"7557\"]					\n						[elementor-template id=\"7621\"]					\n					<h3>WORLD CLASS TAILORING QUALITY </h3>				\n		<p>With over a decade of experience, we have a proven track record of creating innovative and sustainable spaces that enhance the lives of our clients. Our approach to design is centered around collaboration and communication.</p>		\n					<a role=\"button\">\n									Our Story\n					</a>\n					<a role=\"button\">\n									Our Fabrics\n					</a>\n															<img width=\"818\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/GettyImages-138136097-818x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Tie\" srcset=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/GettyImages-138136097-818x1024.jpg 818w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/GettyImages-138136097-64x80.jpg 64w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/GettyImages-138136097-600x751.jpg 600w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/GettyImages-138136097-240x300.jpg 240w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/GettyImages-138136097-768x961.jpg 768w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/GettyImages-138136097.jpg 1058w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 818px) 100vw, 818px\" />															\n					<h5>Personal fit for all</h5>				\n					<a role=\"button\">\n									CUSTOM WEDDING SUITS\n					</a>\n					<a role=\"button\">\n									BESPOKE WOMEN\'S SUITS\n					</a>\n					<a role=\"button\">\n									BESPOKE coats\n					</a>\n					<a role=\"button\">\n									bespoke bow ties\n					</a>\n					<h2>THE PROCESS</h2>				\n					01				\n					BOOK YOUR APPOINTMENT				\n		<p>Book an in-person or virtual appointment with our Design Team.</p>		\n					02				\n					GET MEASURED				\n		<p>We collect 45+ measurements that are a mix of your physical dimensions, the desired dimensions of your custom suit, as well as a posture and fit analysis respectively.</p>		\n					03				\n					CHOOSE YOUR FABRIC, LINING &amp; TRIM				\n		<p>Choose from a rich selection of over 1,000 luxury materials, linings, and buttons.</p>		\n					04				\n					FIRST FITTING				\n		<p>It is time for the \"big reveal\" approximately 8-10 weeks later. We will perform a fit check of your garments and prepare your attire for its finishing touches.</p>		\n					<a role=\"button\">\n									Book an appoitment\n					</a>\n		<p>The modern gentleman’s guide to choosing and caring for the perfectly fitted suit</p>		\n					<a role=\"button\">\n									Read more\n					</a>\n															<img width=\"818\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/GettyImages-1210584470-818x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/GettyImages-1210584470-818x1024.jpg 818w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/GettyImages-1210584470-64x80.jpg 64w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/GettyImages-1210584470-600x751.jpg 600w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/GettyImages-1210584470-240x300.jpg 240w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/GettyImages-1210584470-768x961.jpg 768w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/GettyImages-1210584470.jpg 1058w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 818px) 100vw, 818px\" />															\n					<h3>A CUSTOM SHOP LIKE NO OTHER</h3>				\n		<p>Embark on a captivating exploration down our exclusive alley off the renowned Great Jones Street. Uncover a haven, a tailor shop where you can unwind, savor a refreshing beverage and craft extraordinary custom attire that epitomizes the true essence of your unique personal style.</p>		\n					<a role=\"button\">\n									Explore our locations\n					</a>\n					instagram				\n					Join the adventure				\n					<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/vamtam.themes/\" target=\"_blank\">\n@bespokeinnove</a>				\n					<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/innovecouture.vamtam/\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Follow us\n					</a>\n		<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DS2fU-ijPHB/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"\n			data-full-res=\"https://scontent-dfw6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/608145105_17845647396657621_7485475148648723664_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&#038;_nc_cat=101&#038;ccb=7-5&#038;_nc_sid=18de74&#038;efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&#038;_nc_ohc=KYCAKMJbqrsQ7kNvwFUpAUR&#038;_nc_oc=AdmTOrmZrJPKU7V2ZMU3sOp5p4DuwaweYBqHB7otKlV2ZQLmo59b-s5HTRjx-T_T-UHTfxmqcYGKHZY04KlVVeGL&#038;_nc_zt=23&#038;_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.cdninstagram.com&#038;edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&#038;_nc_gid=lK-bVRvGVyTnPNxfaywFUA&#038;oh=00_AflO6HdwM68LezPOX4MROvDm9T_e24KA8_fgYbpTmXKLUg&#038;oe=69585F95\"\n			data-img-src-set=\"{&quot;d&quot;:&quot;https://scontent-dfw6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/608145105_17845647396657621_7485475148648723664_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=101&amp;ccb=7-5&amp;_nc_sid=18de74&amp;efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&amp;_nc_ohc=KYCAKMJbqrsQ7kNvwFUpAUR&amp;_nc_oc=AdmTOrmZrJPKU7V2ZMU3sOp5p4DuwaweYBqHB7otKlV2ZQLmo59b-s5HTRjx-T_T-UHTfxmqcYGKHZY04KlVVeGL&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.cdninstagram.com&amp;edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=lK-bVRvGVyTnPNxfaywFUA&amp;oh=00_AflO6HdwM68LezPOX4MROvDm9T_e24KA8_fgYbpTmXKLUg&amp;oe=69585F95&quot;,&quot;150&quot;:&quot;https://scontent-dfw6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/608145105_17845647396657621_7485475148648723664_n.