('4565', '1', '2024-01-18 09:42:15', '2024-01-18 09:42:15', '<style>/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 07-02-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h2>Approach</h2>		\n		<p>For over five decades, Innove Couture has epitomized enduring craftsmanship, crafting products designed to withstand the test of time. Embracing an unwavering commitment to uncompromising quality, the brand ensures that each creation is a testament to longevity and responsible manufacturing practices, paving the way for a more sustainable and conscientious future.</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 07-02-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"705\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-anete-lusina-7256873-705x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-anete-lusina-7256873-705x1024.jpg 705w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-anete-lusina-7256873-64x93.jpg 64w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-anete-lusina-7256873-600x872.jpg 600w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-anete-lusina-7256873-206x300.jpg 206w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-anete-lusina-7256873.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 705px) 100vw, 705px\" />													\n													<img width=\"705\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-cottonbro-studio-3738075-705x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-cottonbro-studio-3738075-705x1024.jpg 705w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-cottonbro-studio-3738075-64x93.jpg 64w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-cottonbro-studio-3738075-600x872.jpg 600w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-cottonbro-studio-3738075-206x300.jpg 206w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-cottonbro-studio-3738075.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 705px) 100vw, 705px\" />													\n													<img width=\"1024\" height=\"981\" src=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-cottonbro-studio-3738095-1024x981.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-cottonbro-studio-3738095-1024x981.jpg 1024w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-cottonbro-studio-3738095-1300x1245.jpg 1300w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-cottonbro-studio-3738095-64x61.jpg 64w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-cottonbro-studio-3738095-300x287.jpg 300w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-cottonbro-studio-3738095-768x735.jpg 768w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-cottonbro-studio-3738095-1536x1471.jpg 1536w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-cottonbro-studio-3738095.jpg 1556w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />													\n													<img width=\"492\" height=\"680\" src=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-michael-burrows-7147464.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-michael-burrows-7147464.jpg 492w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-michael-burrows-7147464-64x88.jpg 64w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-michael-burrows-7147464-300x415.jpg 300w, https://innovecouture.vamtam.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/pexels-michael-burrows-7147464-217x300.jpg 217w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 492px) 100vw, 492px\" />													\n			<h2>Commitments</h2>		\n		<p>From suppliers and manufacturers to products, warehouses, stores, and offices, our collective goal is to collaborate and exceed sustainability targets. </p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 07-02-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-divider{--divider-border-style:none;--divider-border-width:1px;--divider-color:#0c0d0e;--divider-icon-size:20px;--divider-element-spacing:10px;--divider-pattern-height:24px;--divider-pattern-size:20px;--divider-pattern-url:none;--divider-pattern-repeat:repeat-x}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider{display:flex}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider__text{font-size:15px;line-height:1;max-width:95%}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider__element{margin:0 var(--divider-element-spacing);flex-shrink:0}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-icon{font-size:var(--divider-icon-size)}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider-separator{display:flex;margin:0;direction:ltr}.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_icon .elementor-divider-separator,.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text .elementor-divider-separator{align-items:center}.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_icon .elementor-divider-separator:after,.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_icon .elementor-divider-separator:before,.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text .elementor-divider-separator:after,.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text .elementor-