('15642', '1', '2026-10-15 16:55:50', '2026-10-15 22:55:50', 'Reimagined in a soft shade of cream, this lambswool Polo Neck has subtle design details such as a contrasting ribbed neck. A saddle shoulder design adds further interest. Wear the neck folded over or upright.\n\nBuy this product on <a href=\"https://www.next.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">next.co.uk</a>', 'Regular Fit Cotton Blend Shirt', '<ul>\n 	<li>Soft Lambswool Fabrication</li>\n 	<li>Saddle shoulder design</li>\n 	<li>High neckline complete with ribbed hemline</li>\n 	<li>Contrasting VB monogram embroidery</li>\n 	<li>Fits true to size, take your regular size</li>\n 	<li>The model\'s height is 180cm and is wearing a size XS</li>\n 	<li>Front Length (Side Neck Point To Hem): 55.5cm</li>\n 	<li>Sleeve Length (From Shoulder): 70.8cm</li>\n 	<li>Main: 100% Lambswool</li>\n 	<li>Specialized Dry Clean Only</li>\n 	<li>Made in Turkey</li>\n</ul>', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '7735-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-10-15 16:55:50', '2026-10-15 22:55:50', '', '7735', 'http://localhost:9070/?p=15642', '0', 'revision', '', '0'),
